    "瓶が待ってる。今日のひと粒、積んでいく？" : {
      "comment" : "Settings: example text of the opt-in daily reminder (an invitation, never pressure)",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Your jar is here whenever you're ready. Add a gem today?"
          }
