    },
    "自己申告の粒は破線つき。総質量には入るが、シェアの既定は実測のみ。" : {
      "comment" : "Manual entry: how self-reported gems look and count",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Self-reported gems have a dashed outline. They count toward your total mass, but shares include only timed gems by default."
